Subject: [PATCH] feat: F-011 Goblin starting zone core scripts

Quest-item spell scripts and event handling for the Lost Isles
goblin start experience on OA Kalimdor map 1.

- 5 quest-credit spell scripts (zeppelin_goblin_start.cpp)
- Fourth and Goal flight-path goal detection (I-248)
- Kaja'Cola on-use handling (I-259)

Closes F-011
---
